OL,3,GNEWSAHow much can the 'July Fortnight'
OL,4,Asave families?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince the 1960s, families in
OL,7,FLeicestershire have avoided the busy
OL,8,Fairport scramble of the peak holiday
OL,9,Fseason. But how much can you actually
OL,10,Fsave with a two-week head start on
OL,11,Fschool holidays?
OL,13,FThe "July Fortnight" was introduced in
OL,14,F1965 after a ballot held among workers
OL,15,Fin Leicester and Leicestershire allowed
OL,16,Ffactories and businesses to close for
OL,17,Fthe first two weeks of the month.
OL,19,FAccording to one local travel agent,
OL,20,Fthe early summer finish still comes as
OL,21,Fa "big advantage" for families taking a
OL,22,Fsummer holiday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
