OL,3,GNEWSAHow much can the 'July Fortnight'
OL,4,Asave families?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC found families with school-age
OL,7,Fchildren in the county can save
OL,8,Fhundreds of pounds by booking holidays
OL,9,Fin mid-July, rather than the peak
OL,10,Fseason.
